+#
+# xterm entries for Microsoft Word (added for Substrate).
+# Word 3.0 caps its screen at ~3000 character cells (cols x lines);
+# keep any custom size under that.  Launch xterm at the SAME geometry,
+# e.g.  xterm -geometry 100x30  with  TERM=xterm-100x30.
